  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Pick rosemary (see ingredients) and roughly chop.\n• Place potato fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and rosemary and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 25-30 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b0fa5a49c635d8ac68e/step-c8627e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice tomato.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices and place in a medium bowl. Cover with water to soak.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Cook sliced onion, stirring regularly, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water. Mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes.\n• Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b0fa5a49c635d8ac68e/step-c8631210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Wash and dry frying pan, then return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Meanwhile, halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire rack in the oven, until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b0fa5a49c635d8ac68e/step-68ab4920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread the bun bases with creamy pesto dressing.\n• Top with mixed salad leaves, tomato slices, haloumi and caramelised onion.\n• Serve with potato fries. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b0fa5a49c635d8ac68e/step-8c2c1d30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
